    "local_patch": "Exl3Backend.run: key the noise generators by activation device. Upstream pins one generator to the compute device, so the noise-floor pass dies on the very first module ('Expected a cpu device type for generator but found cuda'): prefer_cpu modules (the embedding) are loaded on CPU and emit CPU activations. TransformersBackend._noise_hooks already keys generators by device; this makes the exl3 path match. Drop the patch and clear these two fields when upstream fixes it."
